@node Top
@top Casual Symbol Overlay User Guide

Version: 3.0.0-rc.1

Copyright © 2026 @w{Charles Y. Choi}

Casual Symbol Overlay is an opinionated Transient (@ref{Top,transient#Top,,transient,}) user interface for @uref{https://github.com/wolray/symbol-overlay, Symbol Overlay}@comma{} a package to highlight symbols with overlays while providing a keymap for various operations on highlighted symbols.

@image{images/casual-symbol-overlay-screenshot,,,,png}

Casual Symbol Overlay is designed to bring discoverability to many Symbol Overlay commands for an enhanced navigation and editing experience.

Casual Symbol Overlay is an extension package to Casual (@ref{Top,,,casual,})@comma{} which is included as a dependency.


If you enjoy using Casual Symbol Overlay@comma{} please buy me a coffee to help support its development and maintenance.

@image{images/default-yellow,,,,png}

